{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-0226",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "随从人等照例都酣睡了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The attendants, as usual, had all fallen fast asleep.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "源氏公子百无聊赖，只管左思右想：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji was utterly bored and could only turn his thoughts this way and that:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“此女异常无情，但我对她恋念未消，不免情火中烧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"This woman is extraordinarily heartless, yet my longing for her has not faded, and I cannot help burning with passion.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "而且越是无情，越是牵惹我心。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And the more heartless she is, the more she draws my heart.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "一方面作如是想，一方面又念此人冷淡令人吃惊，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "While thinking in this way, he also reflected that this person's coldness was astonishing,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "我也可就此罢休了吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and perhaps he too could simply give up here.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "然而终于不能断念，便对小君说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet in the end he could not abandon the thought, and said to Kogimi:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "“你就带我到她躲藏的地方去吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Take me to the place where she is hiding.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "小君答道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kogimi answered:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "“她那里房门紧闭，侍女众多，怕去不得呢。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"The doors there are tightly shut, and there are many waiting women, so I fear we cannot go.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "他觉得公子十分可怜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He felt very sorry for the prince.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "源氏公子便道：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji then said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "“那么算了吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Then let it be.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "只要你不抛撇我。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Only do not abandon me.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "他命小君睡在身旁。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He had Kogimi sleep beside him.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "小君傍着这青年美貌的公子睡觉，心中十分欢喜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kogimi slept beside this young and beautiful prince and was very happy in his heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p00226",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "源氏公子也觉得那姐姐倒不及这孩子可爱。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Prince Genji too felt that the elder sister was not as lovable as this child.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
